<body>
    <h1>Multi-Firm User Discovery RN Croft</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-BusinessStructure">Business=
 Structure</h1>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"431" style=3D"width:431px;m=
ax-width: 100%;" src=3D"f212eec9b753dfa96a5600180c840958c92e43efc571d603511=
9d5f463c5fa47" height=3D"201"></p>
<p><br></p>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-FirmandKeyContacts">Firm and Key Co=
ntacts</h3>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"1=
7f38049-a833-4e80-9fc9-2952621a41d2"><strong><span class=3D"fui-Link sef-en=
tity-link sef-entity-link fai-bebop ___1brckwx f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16=
muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 =
f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y fbnuktb fpwtdan fljg2da f1bq4y7d=
 fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1qumt79 f6fr8to fwcc4kg f1r2w2so f2hiw=
d2 fd8xqtz fmmm8mr fskwzk7 facljwf fg1gtkf f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm">Jason=
 Ayres </span></strong>CEO: Focused on growth through acquisition and the o=
perational challenges of managing multiple environments.</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"f=
923458d-b341-4285-a7c8-99ce530105f6"><strong><span class=3D"fui-Link sef-en=
tity-link sef-entity-link fai-bebop ___1brckwx f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16=
muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 =
f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y fbnuktb fpwtdan fljg2da f1bq4y7d=
 fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1qumt79 f6fr8to fwcc4kg f1r2w2so f2hiw=
d2 fd8xqtz fmmm8mr fskwzk7 facljwf fg1gtkf f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm">Diane=
 Bode </span></strong>VP Operations and primary operational stakeholder: Re=
sponsible for user setup, access management, password resets, servicing wor=
kflows, and access reviews.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-MostImportantProductInsights-August=
18meeting">Most Important Product Insights - August 18 meeting</h3>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-1.View-OnlyAccessIstheLargestUnmetN=
eed">1. View-Only Access Is the Largest Unmet Need</h4>
<p>The strongest signal in the discussion was demand for&nbsp;<strong>granu=
lar view-only access</strong>. Advisors and referral partners need visibili=
ty into holdings, beneficiary information, transfers, payments, and client =
status without being able to:</p>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"b=
dd2dc7e-4073-410a-89db-6c7ab74c080a">submit service requests</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"8=
9b89d66-90f3-4619-9a29-b2547ef58528">enter orders</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"1=
719b1ec-0bdb-4a03-9e24-03bed0425ad6">modify account settings</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"5=
517e8b5-2de0-437f-992a-88d7e81dc2ca">access operational workflows</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-2.CurrentProvisioningGrantsExcessiv=
eAccess">2. Current Provisioning Grants Excessive Access</h4>
<p>Users requesting limited access are frequently provisioned with broader =
access than requested. This creates administrative overhead and governance =
concerns. Diane described cases where users requested only Compass access b=
ut were granted multiple systems.&nbsp;</p>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-3.Role-BasedAccessControlIsHighlyDe=
sired">3. Role-Based Access Control Is Highly Desired</h4>
<p>The firm explicitly requested:</p>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"0=
8bf6a32-532d-4fd4-b37a-b5064290379c">predefined roles</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"3=
62ee885-7a28-4970-8988-7849c1679cfc">selectable permissions</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"b=
e59eaa1-1c50-461f-befa-b70872e18863">role templates</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"2=
bb50cbc-41d2-40e0-bd1e-ce633c5dff04">configurable restrictions</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"0=
bfb2ffc-8280-4849-b30f-836286e6b39b">reusable onboarding models</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-4.AccessGovernanceVisibilityIsInsuf=
ficient">4. Access Governance Visibility Is Insufficient</h4>
<p>Operations cannot easily verify:</p>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"2=
bd579b6-417d-455a-9480-25f534b17fd9">what permissions users currently have<=
/li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"a=
88678a2-78b4-416d-aaf4-2419990183e6">whether requests were implemented corr=
ectly</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"9=
ee005d5-37b1-4e4b-8123-b10f955835bd">whether departed employees have been f=
ully deactivated</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-UserAccessPainPoints">User Access P=
ain Points</h3>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"5=
6332474-0654-4b96-8289-7510666f6c47">Multiple acquisitions require multiple=
 user IDs and switching across environments.&nbsp;</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"b=
f5bb08c-a9c3-4153-aa4d-1a50b16f72ca">Staff must manually export data for us=
ers who need information without transactional access</li>
 <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=3D"5=
0e6d731-a01e-4ba7-9363-09581153e079">Quarterly attestation is reactive and =
sometimes reveals missed deactivations</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Compass Pain Points&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c255d1ec-1a25-4f69-82d5-7d2cd5a79b27">GIC rate viewing is=
 bundled with GIC order-entry permissions</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"40ffa3bc-d75e-49a4-a391-fbc6ac327d51">FHSA onboarding sti=
ll relies on paper-based processes, creating manual follow-up work</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-KeyRisks">Key Risks</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Risk</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Evidence</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Excessive permissions</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Advisors may receive access to functions the=
y should not use.&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Unauthorized operational activity</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Advisors can potentially enter service reque=
sts or transactions.&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Incorrect GIC transactions</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Users seeking GIC rates may also gain GIC or=
der-entry capability.&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User-offboarding security gaps</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Departed users may remain active until detec=
ted through periodic reviews.&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Complexity from acquisitions</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">More environments increase provisioning and =
oversight risk.&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><strong>RVP Pre-Meeting - June 18, 2026</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cb26855d-0ace-4d26-b1d4-66abbdf8de31">Legacy PM firm with=
 their own broker code, their own Rep Code range, their own account range</=
li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6ea21453-7d73-4415-82ff-3bbc86317fbc">No branches, pooled=
 funds are big strategy, 70% penetration</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1aef4066-6c91-464a-859a-bc4762d4e37b">Historically adviso=
r acquisitions, small books, easy to do with CROFT as they had their own br=
oker code</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"24405fdc-fdce-4869-8b60-69d1e4e2dba3">Croft had Croesus, =
JC Hood had NDEX =E2=86=90 data feed was an issue, avoiding duplicate data =
feed fee, Venable Park was on a different instances of NDEX), merging data =
delivery was confusing</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3b21615e-0f05-41f6-a3cb-29978638c2ca">Access was also a c=
hallenge =E2=86=92 Diane Bode's team couldn't see JC Hood :question: how do=
es she manage this now?</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0e80f535-686a-41a4-8e3e-ee52d60929b1">Started to buy firm=
s in QCPM / ICPMB and this got tricky</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d9f02cdd-298f-4777-ad86-14e381bcd096">Venable Park (Beth,=
 Wendy) moved over for Operations</li>
</ul>
<p>Ken - CCO</p>
<p>Jason - President / CEO&nbsp;</p>
<p>Diane Bode - VP Operations</p>
<p>Operations focus:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f29a4eed-320d-4632-a7af-d19fe646056f">Account opening / m=
aintenance / transfers</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0d06d82c-906e-4bb3-a4b9-e02ba467ddc1">PM system daily rec=
on</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"925c2bef-67c5-4944-a750-b53f0015599b">Management fees (3 =
separate files today)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e0565eb4-bc65-47b2-afce-77aeb8338ae0">myPortfolio+, iMOST=
, myRequest, all specialty teams</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"aaccb9ef-ffe1-4803-9922-3c2f8745d5f9">:question: Trades -=
 MF uploads for their pooled funds (but managed into their retail client ac=
counts), <strong>easier to trade this way without using a separate ID</stro=
ng>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"accce3f4-388d-406d-8565-d231305247ed">Newport, Bridgepo=
rt, Bellwether is also setup like this</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"fe4a65c4-4ef1-4336-8bea-88f266ea5b85">Eddie or Roszana =
tracks all pooled fund accounts</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"8d7cf366-af3c-4498-ab68-2946221282b2">We're not a big f=
an of this, we double-count the accounts</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4f586c31-8467-45d4-86fc-3ee8f33a15ee">Reporting requireme=
nts=20
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"4b0fb239-d7f7-4a0c-b25b-dd12568e4fc9">Quarterly transac=
tional reporting, performance, CRM2/CRM3</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"fb976392-921b-42c3-a815-b496e87890e0">Fund side, fund a=
ccountant (SGGG - Dennis, they strike NAV, Croft signs off) - financial sta=
tements, auditor filing to OSC</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"045f4d2a-5009-4790-89f8-2dd0364f0142">Data Exports =E2=
=86=92 why??&nbsp; &nbsp;PM's can typically rely on their PM system</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p>Diane vs. Wendy</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"19b7710f-deb9-4e7d-b5ff-ba2be15d06da">Aggregation - mostl=
y on fees, firm reconciliation and reporting,&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p>Ken</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"53c386f4-91c3-48cc-a6dd-6865d7dda0a2">Trade surveillance =
across all 3 (mandated), quarterly attestations (for validating trading acc=
ess)</li>
</ul>
<p>Some firms print out what's in NetRep =E2=86=92 we do not send them orde=
rs data</p>
<p>Side note: $220/month per user.&nbsp; NDEX is 10x.&nbsp; D1g1t is ~$50K,=
 Harmony ~$80K</p>
<p>IFM distinction =E2=86=92 nothing prevents them from trading within pool=
ed fund account + retail.&nbsp; QWealth central trade desk manages the fund=
s</p>
<p>GFI has 2-3 strategies but still have 2 traders, low volume</p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-FirmUsageToday">Firm Usage Today</h=
1>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dfe7f261-2d3e-4728-8044-2b5ba4492780">45 Compass users fo=
r RN Croft</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1e245ebd-7313-463e-aaa6-4603436cae05">3 users from Venabl=
e Park</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryRNCroft-HistoricalFeedback&amp;Observations=
">Historical Feedback &amp; Observations</h1>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li data-uuid=3D"0c39f544-d743-4f60-b75c-9139e6e6e86f">Questions from them=
 on transition, etc. =E2=86=92 mostly Servicing and all resolved</li>
</ul>
<p>Reported Pain Points from M&amp;A experience</p>
<p>JC Hood</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"657865f3-1bf3-44ed-ad61-773d14793cfb">Data and user acces=
s was problematic&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"608f4d0c-8075-4ec8-a3f6-1dce60aa92a6"><span>Needed separa=
te ID's for all applications for both firms&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dadff53d-4461-437e-83db-e6f37288dc84"><span>Would rather =
have 3 ID's than re-paper client accounts&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d65c6aa6-d6c3-4b44-8d18-dc3bd9b6428f"><span>Data transiti=
on was messy. Ultimately a solution was found by the data team to add a fee=
d in Croesus</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Veneble Park&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"47d2c08d-d947-47b9-b928-9eb2ba1f7d99">More ID's for each =
user were required&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"de68ac1e-860d-47cb-afdb-14a1dc79cef5">Acquired users from=
 Venable Park (Wendy and Danielle)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b0ef0216-0179-4ee1-87e1-f6e28f0545e6">new Data feed set u=
p was problematic</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Summary of pain points from Venable Park merger (source Implemen=
tation team):&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3c08540d-1137-4caa-9824-62b375e23b15"><span>Need for acce=
ss to acquired firm RR codes</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"efe19d08-18b1-4a0a-a620-ad630e205713"><span>Uncertainty a=
bout login requirements&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fc91199d-5a94-4a00-8c6b-ff1552b119cd"><span>Inability to =
merge access profiles&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"caa415f7-45f7-4d1f-97c8-3a6221bb6c71"><span>Requirement t=
o work across multiple environments</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c244bc98-7589-4ac3-8a4e-7c0c01f780e2"><span>Delays in use=
r access setup - SAA&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9ac42f26-488d-42e2-999c-77c707c94f73"><span>Missing clien=
